    "Astro Bridge is accessible from your private network.": "可从私有网络访问 Astro Bridge。",
    "At least 8 characters. Hotspot: 8–63 bytes (or a 64-character hexadecimal key). Changing the hotspot password disconnects its clients. Changing the web password ends sessions.": "至少 8 个字符。热点：8–63 字节（或 64 位十六进制密钥）。更改热点密码会断开客户端，更改网页密码会结束会话。",
