    "Connect Wi-Fi adapters through a powered USB hub to use several telescopes simultaneously. Allow one adapter for each connected telescope, plus one for the private network.": "使用带电源的 USB 集线器连接多个 Wi-Fi 适配器，以同时使用多台望远镜。每台已连接的望远镜需要一个适配器，私有网络另需一个。",
