    "Certificate action": "证书操作",
    "Certificate chain valid at last diagnostic check": "上次诊断时证书链有效",
    "Certificate checks use the bridge clock. Last issuance evidence is historical; it does not prove current synchronization.": "证书检查使用网桥时钟。上次签发的时间依据只是历史记录，不证明当前已同步。",
    "Certificate diagnostics need refreshing. HTTP recovery remains available.": "需要刷新证书诊断。HTTP 恢复访问仍可用。",
    "Certificate hostname differs from the bridge name": "证书主机名与网桥名称不同",
    "Certificate identity": "证书身份",
    "Certificate identity is invalid": "证书身份无效",
    "Certificate is not yet valid according to the bridge clock": "按网桥时钟，证书尚未生效",
    "Certificate operation completed. Check listener readiness and client trust separately.": "证书操作已完成。请分别检查监听器就绪情况和客户端信任。",
    "Certificate operation is running. Accepted does not mean HTTPS is ready.": "证书操作正在运行。请求已接受不代表 HTTPS 已就绪。",
    "Checking secure access support…": "正在检查安全访问支持…",
    "Chrony synchronized at last issuance": "上次签发时 Chrony 已同步",
    "Clock at last diagnostic check": "上次诊断时的时钟",
    "Compare with an independent trusted clock. This assertion is used once, must match the bridge within 120 seconds and never changes its clock or proves NTP sync.": "请与独立可靠时钟比较。此确认仅使用一次，须与网桥相差不超过 120 秒，不会更改时钟，也不证明 NTP 同步。",
    "Diagnostics observed {seconds} seconds ago.": "诊断观测于 {seconds} 秒前。",
    "Disable HTTPS, keep identity": "禁用 HTTPS，保留身份",
    "Disable keeps the identity and installed trust. Reset or renaming requires a new setup and renewed trust; remove the old CA in each device’s settings. The bridge cannot remove client trust.": "禁用会保留身份和已安装的信任。重置或改名需要重新设置和信任；请在每台设备设置中删除旧 CA。网桥无法移除客户端信任。",
    "Download only the public CA certificate. Installing a local CA changes your device’s trust store; a compromised signing key can affect more than this page. Install trust yourself only after independent comparison.": "仅下载公开 CA 证书。安装本地 CA 会更改设备信任库；签名密钥泄露可能影响此页面以外的访问。请独立比较后自行安装信任。",
    "Download public CA certificate": "下载公开 CA 证书",
    "Enable existing identity": "启用现有身份",
    "Enter independently verified UTC in the displayed format.": "按显示格式输入独立核实的 UTC。",
    "HTTP recovery access": "HTTP 恢复访问",
    "HTTPS is optional. Keep HTTP available for recovery. Your devices must explicitly trust this bridge’s own certificate before secure access and installation can work.": "HTTPS 为可选功能。请保留 HTTP 用于恢复。设备必须明确信任此网桥自己的证书后，才能使用安全访问和安装。",
    "HTTPS listener": "HTTPS 监听器",
    "HTTPS listener ready. Browser trust still needs verification.": "HTTPS 监听器已就绪。仍需验证浏览器信任。",
    "HTTPS listener unavailable. Use HTTP recovery.": "HTTPS 监听器不可用。请使用 HTTP 恢复访问。",
    "I independently verified current UTC for this operation.": "我已为本次操作独立核实当前 UTC。",
    "I understand reset removes this identity and I must remove its old trust from each device.": "我理解重置会删除此身份，且必须在每台设备上移除旧信任。",
    "Last issuance clock evidence": "上次签发时钟依据",
    "Native apps may not trust user-installed CAs automatically. Configure their CA trust explicitly while keeping hostname and chain verification.": "原生应用可能不会自动信任用户安装的 CA。请明确配置 CA 信任，同时保留主机名和证书链验证。",
    "Not configured": "未配置",
    "On iPhone or iPad, installing the certificate profile is not enough: explicitly enable full SSL trust in General → About → Certificate Trust Settings. Android CA settings vary by manufacturer; browser trust must be checked on the actual device.": "在 iPhone 或 iPad 上，仅安装证书描述文件还不够：请在“通用 → 关于本机 → 证书信任设置”中明确启用 SSL 完全信任。Android 的 CA 设置因厂商而异，须在实际设备上检查浏览器信任。",
    "Open HTTPS and sign in again": "打开 HTTPS 并重新登录",
    "Open the HTTPS hostname and authenticate again. Continue only when the browser accepts the certificate normally; never bypass a certificate warning. Then use its Install or Add to Home Screen menu if offered.": "打开 HTTPS 主机名并重新认证。仅在浏览器正常接受证书时继续，绝不要绕过证书警告。之后可使用浏览器提供的“安装”或“添加到主屏幕”。",
    "Owner-confirmed UTC at last issuance (not NTP proof)": "上次签发时由所有者确认的 UTC（不是 NTP 证明）",
    "Refresh certificate diagnostics": "刷新证书诊断",
    "Renew server certificate (same CA)": "续签服务器证书（相同 CA）",
    "Reset certificate identity": "重置证书身份",
    "Secure access is optional. Trust on this browser has not been verified.": "安全访问为可选功能。尚未验证此浏览器的信任。",
    "The bridge is stopping or a reboot is already scheduled.": "网桥正在停止，或已计划重启。",
    "Secure local access (optional)": "安全本地访问（可选）",
    "Server certificate expired; renewal requires verified current UTC": "服务器证书已过期；续签需要已核实的当前 UTC",
    "Server certificate expires (UTC)": "服务器证书到期时间（UTC）",
    "Set up a new device identity": "设置新的设备身份",
    "Set up the identity, then compare the CA fingerprint through the bridge console or an already trusted, pinned SSH connection. The fingerprint on this HTTP page is not independent proof.": "设置身份后，通过网桥控制台或已受信任且固定主机密钥的 SSH 连接比较 CA 指纹。此 HTTP 页面上的指纹不是独立证明。",
    "Synchronization unverified at last diagnostic check": "上次诊断时同步状态未核实",
    "Synchronize current UTC or independently verify it for this operation.": "同步当前 UTC，或为本次操作独立核实。",
    "Synchronized when diagnostics were refreshed": "刷新诊断时已同步",
    "The certificate operation failed. Refresh diagnostics before retrying.": "证书操作失败。请刷新诊断后重试。",
    "The current web interface password is incorrect.": "当前网页界面密码错误。",
    "This OS does not provide the required certificate helper. An app update cannot install it.": "此操作系统不提供所需证书助手。应用更新无法安装它。",
