    "Wait before refreshing certificate diagnostics again.": "请稍候再刷新证书诊断。",
    "Discover telescopes": "发现望远镜",
    "Check connected Seestar networks": "检查已连接的 Seestar 网络",
    "Discovery does not connect or verify an instrument. Suggested type, name and default IP must be checked; a Wi-Fi scan reveals no password or serial.": "发现不会连接或验证设备。建议的类型、名称和默认 IP 需要核实；Wi-Fi 扫描不会透露密码或序列号。",
    "Physical access point BSSID (optional)": "物理接入点 BSSID（可选）",
    "I confirm this physical access point belongs to this profile. This is owner confirmation, not manufacturer verification.": "我确认此物理接入点属于此配置。这是所有者确认，而非制造商验证。",
    "Bind the selected observation after saving this profile": "保存此配置后绑定所选观测",
    "Bind or correct identity": "绑定或修正身份",
    "Unlink physical identity": "解除物理身份绑定",
    "Binding or unlinking does not change the Wi-Fi selector or the active connection. Use a selected discovery network and save to change the BSSID selector; automatic selection is not implemented.": "绑定或解绑不会更改 Wi-Fi 选择条件或当前连接。更改 BSSID 选择条件须选择发现的网络并保存；尚未实现自动选择。",
    "Wi-Fi observed (not manufacturer verified)": "Wi-Fi 观测（未经制造商验证）",
    "Owner confirmed (not manufacturer verified)": "所有者确认（未经制造商验证）",
    "No physical identity bound. This profile can still be selected by its profile ID.": "未绑定物理身份。仍可通过配置 ID 选择此配置。",
    "Binding differs from the saved Wi-Fi selector. Binding alone does not change which access point is joined.": "绑定与保存的 Wi-Fi 选择条件不同。仅绑定不会更改实际连接的接入点。",
    "Save the profile before binding its identity.": "请先保存配置，再绑定身份。",
    "Confirm the physical access point before binding.": "绑定前请确认物理接入点。",
    "Replace this binding and unlink it from conflicting profiles: {profiles}?": "替换此绑定，并从冲突配置中解绑：{profiles}？",
    "Physical binding saved. Wi-Fi selection and active connections are unchanged.": "物理绑定已保存。Wi-Fi 选择与当前连接未更改。",
    "No confidently spare radio is available. Management and telescope connections were preserved. Enter settings manually.": "没有确定可用的备用无线接口。管理和望远镜连接已保留。请手动输入设置。",
    "No supported directly attached device replied. Serial/model identity remains unknown.": "没有受支持的直连设备回应。序列号和型号身份仍未知。",
    "Observed candidates; device identity and observation time are unverified.": "观测到的候选设备；设备身份与观测时间未经验证。",
    "Seestar scan response; serial/model unknown. This is not a physical binding.": "Seestar 扫描回应；序列号和型号未知。这不是物理绑定。",
    "Wi-Fi observation": "Wi-Fi 观测",
    "Type/name/default IP are suggestions only. A scan does not verify the instrument or supply credentials.": "类型、名称、默认 IP 仅为建议。扫描不会验证设备或提供凭据。",
    "Profile saved, but physical binding failed. Edit this existing profile to retry; do not add it again.": "配置已保存，但物理绑定失败。请编辑现有配置以重试，不要重复添加。",
    "Last-seen frequency hint": "上次观测频率提示",
    "Device clock unverified": "设备时钟未验证",
    "Keep existing aliases and add this access point": "保留现有别名并添加此接入点",
    "Remove alias {bssid}": "删除别名 {bssid}",
    "Remove alias {bssid}?": "删除别名 {bssid}？",
    "A network operation is already running.": "网络操作已在运行。",
