    "Explicit automatic connections": "显式自动连接",
    "Allow Auto-connect requests": "允许自动连接请求",
    "Both this policy and instrument eligibility must be enabled. Only an explicit profile-ID request can use a genuinely free connection. No idle replacement, forced eviction or generic maker-app trigger is implemented.": "必须同时启用此策略和设备资格。只有显式配置 ID 请求才能使用真正空闲的连接。尚未实现空闲替换、强制驱逐或通用原厂应用触发。",
    "Allow this instrument in explicit Auto-connect requests": "允许此设备参与显式自动连接请求",
    "Ensure connection": "确保连接",
    "Enable global Auto-connect and this instrument eligibility first.": "请先启用全局自动连接及此设备的资格。",
    "No confidently free radio is available; existing connections were preserved.": "没有确定空闲的无线接口；现有连接已保留。",
    "Several access points match. Select and save the exact BSSID first.": "多个接入点匹配。请先选择并保存准确的 BSSID。",
    "The selected network was not observed. Check that the instrument is switched on.": "未观测到所选网络。请确认设备已开机。",
