    "The saved Wi-Fi selector differs from the physical binding. Correct it explicitly.": "保存的 Wi-Fi 选择条件与物理绑定不同。请明确修正。",
    "The associated access point differs from the selected observation. Forwarding was withheld.": "已关联的接入点不同于所选观测。未启用转发。",
    "This enabled instrument already has manual reconnect intent. Wait or disconnect it explicitly.": "此启用设备已有手动重连意图。请等待或明确断开。",
