    "The service restarted. Check current connection status.": "服务已重启。请检查当前连接状态。",
    "Configuration changed during the operation; the automatic attempt stopped.": "操作期间配置发生变化；自动尝试已停止。",
    "Connection readiness could not be confirmed. Check current status.": "无法确认连接就绪。请检查当前状态。",
    "Selecting a genuinely free connection…": "正在选择真正空闲的连接…",
