    "No eligible Seestar is configured.": "未配置符合资格的 Seestar。",
    "Maker discovery is bounded by cooldown and current connection safety checks.": "原厂发现受冷却期和当前连接安全检查限制。",
    "Connection pause state is unavailable. Recover it before retrying instruments. All instruments will remain paused.": "连接暂停状态不可用。重试设备前请先恢复。所有设备将保持暂停。",
    "Paused instruments: {names}. Use an explicit manual Connect or Disconnect to retry safely.": "已暂停设备：{names}。请明确手动连接或断开以安全重试。",
