    "Allow Vespera connection requests to select the unique eligible Vespera at that target IP": "允许 Vespera 连接请求选择该目标 IP 地址上唯一符合条件的 Vespera",
    "Vespera requests must reach the bridge through a route. Detection does not authenticate Singularity; the app may need to retry after Wi-Fi connection.": "Vespera 请求必须经由路由到达桥接器。此检测不会验证 Singularity 的身份；Wi-Fi 连接后，可能需要在应用中重试。",
