    "Allow DWARF LAN discovery to request the unique eligible DWARF": "允许 LAN 上的 DWARF 发现请求连接唯一符合条件的 DWARF",
    "These options can interrupt an unprotected exposure, including when combined. Ambiguous eligible instruments require explicit selection. Other maker-app triggers remain unsupported.": "这些选项可能中断未受保护的曝光，组合使用时也不例外。若无法唯一确定符合条件的设备，必须明确选择。仍不支持由其他厂商应用触发连接。",
    "Several eligible DWARFs: select an instrument explicitly.": "有多台符合条件的 DWARF：请明确选择一台设备。",
    "Existing reachable DWARF preserved.": "保留现有可访问的 DWARF。",
    "No eligible DWARF is configured.": "未配置符合条件的 DWARF。",
    "Passive DWARF detection is unavailable here.": "此处无法使用 DWARF 被动检测。",
    "Passive DWARF detection is waiting for a confirmed management interface.": "DWARF 被动检测正在等待已确认的管理接口。",
    "DWARF discovery trigger is disabled.": "DWARF 发现触发已禁用。",
    "Listening for DWARF discovery requests.": "正在等待 DWARF 发现请求。",
    "DWARF connection requested; native-app acceptance is not confirmed.": "已请求连接 DWARF；尚未确认原厂应用的兼容性。",
    "DWARF discovery is passive only: it can request a connection but sends no discovery replies. Use the remembered Pi IP in the native app; first-time automatic discovery is unavailable.": "DWARF 发现仅为被动监听：可请求连接，但不发送发现回复。请使用原厂应用中记住的 Pi IP 地址；不支持首次自动发现。",
    "DWARF app IP: {ip} (TCP 9900 / 8082 / 554)": "DWARF 应用 IP：{ip}（TCP 9900 / 8082 / 554）",
    "DWARF Pi proxy unavailable: another instrument owns the required ports. Direct target routing may still work.": "Pi 的 DWARF 代理不可用：其他设备已占用所需端口。直接路由至目标地址可能仍可使用。",
