    "Install iPhone certificate profile": "安装 iPhone 证书描述文件",
    "Internet access is required for background delivery. Instrument names may appear on the lock screen. Signing out stops notifications on all devices.": "后台推送需要互联网。锁定屏幕可能显示设备名称。退出登录将停止所有设备的通知。",
    "Open trusted HTTPS to set up notifications.": "请打开受信任的 HTTPS 以设置通知。",
    "On iPhone, add this HTTPS page to the Home Screen, then open its icon.": "在 iPhone 上，将此 HTTPS 页面添加到主屏幕，然后打开其图标。",
    "Push notifications are unavailable in this browser.": "此浏览器不支持推送通知。",
    "Notification support is not installed on this bridge.": "此桥接器未安装通知支持。",
    "Notifications are blocked. Allow them in this device’s notification settings.": "通知已被阻止。请在此设备的通知设置中允许通知。",
    "Notifications are enabled on this device.": "此设备已启用通知。",
    "Notifications are off on this device.": "此设备的通知已关闭。",
