    "DWARF": "DWARF",
    "Seestar": "Seestar",
    "Vespera": "Vespera",
    "HTTPS is not available on this bridge. Update its system image before setting up this device.": "此桥接器不支持 HTTPS。请先更新其系统镜像，再设置此设备。",
    "PWA & notifications": "PWA 与通知",
    "Install Astro Bridge as an app": "将 Astro Bridge 安装为应用",
    "Astro Bridge is a progressive web app (PWA). Add it to your Home Screen or desktop, then enable notifications for telescope connections and disconnections.": "Astro Bridge 是一款渐进式 Web 应用（PWA）。将其添加到主屏幕或桌面，然后启用望远镜连接和断开的通知。",
    "Telescope types included in automatic switching": "参与自动切换的望远镜类型",
    "Searches from these apps can request a switch to a saved telescope of the selected type. Uncheck a type to exclude it.": "这些应用的搜索可请求切换到所选类型的已保存望远镜。取消勾选某个类型即可将其排除。",
    "Included telescope types: {types}": "包含的望远镜类型：{types}",
