    "Confirm the physical access point before binding.": "繫結前請確認實體存取點。",
    "Replace this binding and unlink it from conflicting profiles: {profiles}?": "取代此繫結，並從衝突設定檔解除：{profiles}？",
    "Physical binding saved. Wi-Fi selection and active connections are unchanged.": "實體繫結已儲存。Wi-Fi 選擇與目前連線未變更。",
    "No confidently spare radio is available. Management and telescope connections were preserved. Enter settings manually.": "沒有確定可用的備用無線介面。管理與望遠鏡連線已保留。請手動輸入設定。",
    "No supported directly attached device replied. Serial/model identity remains unknown.": "沒有受支援的直連裝置回應。序號與型號身分仍未知。",
    "Observed candidates; device identity and observation time are unverified.": "觀測到的候選裝置；裝置身分與觀測時間未經驗證。",
    "Seestar scan response; serial/model unknown. This is not a physical binding.": "Seestar 掃描回應；序號與型號未知。這不是實體繫結。",
    "Wi-Fi observation": "Wi-Fi 觀測",
    "Type/name/default IP are suggestions only. A scan does not verify the instrument or supply credentials.": "類型、名稱、預設 IP 僅為建議。掃描不會驗證設備或提供認證資訊。",
    "Profile saved, but physical binding failed. Edit this existing profile to retry; do not add it again.": "設定檔已儲存，但實體繫結失敗。請編輯現有設定檔以重試，不要重複新增。",
