    "Keep existing aliases and add this access point": "保留現有別名並新增此存取點",
    "Remove alias {bssid}": "移除別名 {bssid}",
    "Remove alias {bssid}?": "移除別名 {bssid}？",
    "A network operation is already running.": "網路操作已在執行。",
    "Wait before discovering devices again.": "請稍候再探索裝置。",
    "The radio state or scan could not be established safely.": "無法安全確定無線介面狀態或掃描結果。",
    "Discover again before binding this observation.": "繫結此觀測前請重新探索。",
    "This response does not establish a physical identity or access point.": "此回應無法確定實體身分或存取點。",
    "Reload the current configuration before binding.": "繫結前請重新載入目前設定。",
    "Configuration changed. Reload it before binding.": "設定已變更。繫結前請重新載入。",
    "Check the physical BSSID, SSID and confirmations, then try again.": "請檢查實體 BSSID、SSID 與確認項目後重試。",
    "Explicit automatic connections": "明確的自動連線",
    "Allow Auto-connect requests": "允許自動連線要求",
    "Both this policy and instrument eligibility must be enabled. Only an explicit profile-ID request can use a genuinely free connection. No idle replacement, forced eviction or generic maker-app trigger is implemented.": "必須同時啟用此原則與設備資格。只有明確的設定檔 ID 要求才能使用真正閒置的連線。尚未實作閒置替換、強制逐出或通用原廠應用程式觸發。",
    "Allow this instrument in explicit Auto-connect requests": "允許此設備參與明確自動連線要求",
    "Ensure connection": "確保連線",
    "Enable global Auto-connect and this instrument eligibility first.": "請先啟用全域自動連線及此設備的資格。",
    "No confidently free radio is available; existing connections were preserved.": "沒有確定閒置的無線介面；現有連線已保留。",
