    "The selected network was not observed. Check that the instrument is switched on.": "未觀測到所選網路。請確認設備已開機。",
    "No free radio supports the observed network band.": "沒有閒置無線介面支援觀測到的頻段。",
    "The target overlaps an active network; use these instruments separately.": "目標與作用中網路重疊；請分別使用這些設備。",
    "The saved Wi-Fi selector differs from the physical binding. Correct it explicitly.": "儲存的 Wi-Fi 選擇條件與實體繫結不同。請明確修正。",
    "The associated access point differs from the selected observation. Forwarding was withheld.": "已關聯的存取點不同於所選觀測。未啟用轉送。",
    "This enabled instrument already has manual reconnect intent. Wait or disconnect it explicitly.": "此啟用設備已有手動重新連線意圖。請等待或明確中斷。",
    "An old association still needs cleanup before allocation.": "指派前仍須清理舊關聯。",
    "The connection did not become ready before its deadline.": "連線未在期限內就緒。",
    "The Wi-Fi association failed; no automatic retry was left enabled.": "Wi-Fi 關聯失敗；沒有保留自動重試。",
    "A connection operation is already pending.": "連線操作已在等待完成。",
    "Reload the current configuration before requesting a connection.": "要求連線前請重新載入目前設定。",
    "Configuration changed. Reload it before requesting a connection.": "設定已變更。要求連線前請重新載入。",
    "Private-network management is not currently ready.": "私人網路管理目前未就緒。",
