    "Connection readiness could not be confirmed. Check current status.": "無法確認連線就緒。請檢查目前狀態。",
    "Selecting a genuinely free connection…": "正在選擇真正閒置的連線…",
    "Associating Wi-Fi; readiness is not confirmed…": "正在關聯 Wi-Fi；尚未確認就緒…",
    "Wi-Fi associated; checking forwarding and services…": "Wi-Fi 已關聯；正在檢查轉送與服務…",
    "Cleaning up the automatic attempt…": "正在清理自動嘗試…",
    "Ensure completed. Current connection state is shown in the dashboard.": "確保連線操作已完成。面板顯示目前連線狀態。",
    "Cleanup is unconfirmed. Keep management access and check diagnostics.": "清理尚未確認。請保留管理存取並檢查診斷。",
    "Original desired settings were preserved; the automatic attempt stopped.": "原有期望設定已保留；自動嘗試已停止。",
    "Target {ip}; direct-route availability and maker-app acceptance remain unverified.": "目標 {ip}；直接路由可用性與原廠應用程式相容性仍未驗證。",
    "This physical access point is already in use by another enabled instrument.": "此實體存取點已被另一個啟用設備使用。",
    "Another enabled instrument has an unverified selector for this network. Select exact access points first.": "另一個啟用設備在此網路上的選擇條件未驗證。請先選擇準確的存取點。",
    "Connection protection": "連線保護",
    "A quiet exposure may still be active. Reserve a ready connection and renew before expiry, or use an owner lock that survives reboot. Logging out does not release reservations; restarting the bridge loses client reservations.": "即使沒有通訊，曝光也可能繼續。請預約就緒連線並在到期前續期，或使用重新啟動後仍有效的擁有者鎖定。登出不會釋出預約；重新啟動網橋會遺失用戶端預約。",
    "Current administrator password": "目前管理員密碼",
    "I confirm this change to connection protection.": "我確認此次連線保護變更。",
    "Forwarded activity observed": "已觀測到轉送活動",
    "Quiet window observed; this does not prove an exposure ended.": "已觀測到安靜時段；這不證明曝光已結束。",
