    "Activity measurement unavailable": "活動測量無法使用",
    "Path matches: {packets} packets / {bytes} bytes; established TCP: {count}.": "路徑符合：{packets} 個封包 / {bytes} 位元組；已建立 TCP：{count}。",
    "Owner locked": "擁有者已鎖定",
    "Reserve 2 min": "預約 2 分鐘",
    "Remove owner lock": "移除擁有者鎖定",
    "Owner lock": "擁有者鎖定",
    "This connection is protected. Release reservations and remove its owner lock first.": "此連線受保護。請先釋出預約並移除擁有者鎖定。",
    "Only the owning session can renew or release this reservation.": "僅擁有此預約的工作階段可以續期或釋出。",
    "This reservation was renewed. Refresh before releasing it.": "預約已續期。釋出前請重新整理。",
    "Reservation expired or the bridge restarted. Check current protection.": "預約已過期或網橋已重新啟動。請檢查目前保護。",
    "Current administrator password is incorrect.": "目前管理員密碼錯誤。",
    "Too many password attempts. Try again later.": "密碼嘗試次數過多。請稍後重試。",
    "Reserve an already ready connection; a reservation does not connect it.": "請預約已就緒連線；預約不會啟動連線。",
