    "Renew 2 min": "續期 2 分鐘",
    "Release reservation": "釋出預約",
    "Owner release…": "擁有者釋出…",
    "No reservations or owner locks.": "沒有預約或擁有者鎖定。",
    "Release another client’s reservation": "釋出另一用戶端的預約",
    "This may remove protection for another app’s exposure. Confirm only after checking that it is safe. A renewed reservation requires a fresh confirmation.": "這可能移除另一應用程式曝光的保護。僅在確認安全後操作。續期後的預約需要重新確認。",
    "An owner lock survives restart and blocks conflicting connection and maintenance actions until explicitly removed.": "擁有者鎖定會在重新啟動後保留，在明確移除前阻止衝突的連線與維護操作。",
    "Optional hotspot change deferred while a connection is protected.": "連線受保護，已暫緩選用熱點變更。",
    "No unprotected radio is available for recovery access. The protected connection was not taken.": "沒有未受保護的無線介面可供復原存取。未占用受保護連線。",
    "Apply": "套用",
    "Activity diagnostics": "活動診斷",
    "Measurements describe matches on owned allowed forwarding paths, not guaranteed delivery or the end of an exposure.": "測量描述的是自有允許轉送路徑的符合情況，不保證送達，也不證明曝光結束。",
    "First installation, adopted unclassified sessions or lost counter history keep coverage unknown. After OS support is installed, only a later safe OS reboot can establish a fresh baseline; restarting the app is insufficient. Do not reboot during an exposure or while protections remain.": "首次安裝、接管未分類工作階段或遺失計數器歷史，都會使涵蓋範圍維持未知。安裝作業系統支援後，只有之後安全重新啟動作業系統才能建立新基準；重新啟動應用程式不足以證明。曝光期間或保護仍有效時請勿重新啟動。",
    "Old images need OS support (conntrack 1.4.9 or later). An application update cannot install it. Keep an owner lock until coverage is established.": "舊映像需要作業系統支援（conntrack 1.4.9 或更新版）。應用程式更新無法安裝它。建立涵蓋範圍前請維持擁有者鎖定。",
    "Demonstration does not measure Linux traffic.": "示範不會測量 Linux 流量。",
    "Linux activity measurement is unavailable. OS support may be missing; application OTA cannot install it.": "Linux 活動測量無法使用。可能缺少作業系統支援；應用程式 OTA 無法安裝它。",
    "Coverage is uncertain. Read the bootstrap and counter-history guidance before relying on quiet measurements.": "涵蓋範圍不確定。依賴安靜測量前，請閱讀初始基準與計數器歷史說明。",
    "Cached Linux observations use one shared collector across browser tabs.": "多個瀏覽器分頁共用一個收集器，使用快取的 Linux 觀測。",
    "Client reservations: {leases} · Owner locks: {locks}": "用戶端預約：{leases} · 擁有者鎖定：{locks}",
    "Requests prefer a free compatible connection, then a consenting quiet instrument. Reservations and owner locks always prevent replacement. No traffic does not prove that an exposure ended.": "要求優先使用閒置相容連線，再選擇已同意且安靜的設備。預約與擁有者鎖定一律阻止替換。無流量不證明曝光已結束。",
    "Quiet interval (seconds)": "安靜間隔（秒）",
    "Replacement cooldown (seconds)": "替換冷卻時間（秒）",
    "Advanced interruption policy": "進階中斷原則",
    "Allow first consenting instrument replacement even when active or activity is unknown": "允許替換第一個同意的設備，即使它活躍或活動未知",
    "Allow Seestar LAN discovery to request the unique eligible Seestar": "允許 Seestar 區域網路探索要求唯一符合資格的 Seestar",
    "I accept these interruption risks for this policy change.": "我接受本次原則變更的中斷風險。",
    "Save automatic policy": "儲存自動原則",
    "Allow automatic requests to replace this instrument when eligible": "允許自動要求在符合條件時替換此設備",
    "Recover paused connection state…": "復原暫停連線狀態…",
    "Recovery keeps all instruments paused. Release reservations and owner locks first. Then explicitly Connect or Disconnect each saved instrument; no connection is retried automatically.": "復原會讓所有設備維持暫停。請先釋出預約與擁有者鎖定，再明確連接或中斷每個已儲存設備；不會自動重試連線。",
    "No consenting, unprotected and freshly quiet connection is available.": "沒有已同意、未保護且經最新測量確認安靜的連線。",
    "A replacement cooldown is active. No retry is queued.": "替換冷卻期仍有效。沒有排隊重試。",
    "A recent failed request is cooling down. Check the instrument before retrying.": "最近要求失敗後的冷卻期仍有效。重試前請檢查設備。",
    "This instrument is paused after an unconfirmed restoration. Use an explicit manual Connect or Disconnect.": "此設備因復原未確認而暫停。請明確手動連接或中斷。",
    "Restoring the previous instrument; readiness is not yet confirmed…": "正在還原先前設備；尚未確認就緒…",
    "Releasing the selected consenting instrument…": "正在釋出選定且已同意的設備…",
    "Forced interruption of {name}": "強制中斷 {name}",
    "Quiet replacement of {name}": "替換安靜的 {name}",
    "Previous connection restored and ready.": "先前連線已還原並就緒。",
    "Restoration unconfirmed: instrument paused until explicit owner action.": "還原未確認：設備暫停，等待擁有者明確操作。",
    "Maker discovery trigger is disabled.": "原廠探索觸發已停用。",
    "Several eligible Seestars: select an instrument explicitly.": "有多個符合資格的 Seestar：請明確選擇設備。",
    "Existing reachable Seestar preserved.": "已保留現有可存取的 Seestar。",
    "Seestar discovery requested a connection; readiness is not confirmed.": "Seestar 探索已要求連線；尚未確認就緒。",
    "No eligible Seestar is configured.": "未設定符合資格的 Seestar。",
    "Maker discovery is bounded by cooldown and current connection safety checks.": "原廠探索受冷卻期與目前連線安全檢查限制。",
    "Connection pause state is unavailable. Recover it before retrying instruments. All instruments will remain paused.": "連線暫停狀態無法使用。重試設備前請先復原。所有設備將維持暫停。",
    "Paused instruments: {names}. Use an explicit manual Connect or Disconnect to retry safely.": "已暫停設備：{names}。請明確手動連接或中斷以安全重試。",
    "Automatic policy saved.": "自動原則已儲存。",
