    "Use the remembered bridge IP in the manufacturer app; first-time discovery is unavailable.": "請在原廠應用程式中使用已儲存的橋接器 IP；暫不支援首次自動探索。",
    "Stored-image access has not been validated.": "尚未驗證已儲存影像的存取。",
