    "All traffic protects the connection.": "所有流量都會保護連線。",
    "Bounded background exchanges are excluded; transfers and unknown activity remain protected.": "少量背景通訊除外；資料傳輸和未知活動仍受保護。",
    "Technical details": "技術詳細資訊",
