    "Connected: {count}": "已連線：{count}",
    "Connect a telescope by its IP address.": "透過 IP 位址連接望遠鏡。",
    "Use Singularity through Astro Bridge.": "透過 Astro Bridge 使用 Singularity。",
    "Use DWARFLAB through Astro Bridge.": "透過 Astro Bridge 使用 DWARFLAB。",
