    "Another device uses these app ports. Use its direct address or disconnect the other device.": "另一台設備正在使用這些應用程式連接埠。請使用儀器的直接位址或中斷另一台設備。",
    "Step 1 of 2": "第1步，共2步",
    "Find your telescope": "尋找望遠鏡",
    "Turn on your telescope. Astro Bridge recognizes supported telescope and mount Wi-Fi networks.": "請開啟望遠鏡。Astro Bridge 可辨識支援的望遠鏡和赤道儀 Wi-Fi 網路。",
