    "Add manually": "手動加入",
    "Choose another telescope": "選擇其他望遠鏡",
    "The manufacturer's default password is filled in. Change it only if you changed the telescope's Wi-Fi password.": "已填入廠商預設密碼。僅在您變更過望遠鏡 Wi-Fi 密碼時修改。",
    "Advanced connection settings": "進階連線設定",
    "Step 2 of 2 — check the details, then add your telescope.": "第2步，共2步 — 檢查資訊後加入望遠鏡。",
    "Settings filled in for this Wi-Fi network. You can add the telescope now or edit the details.": "已填入此 Wi-Fi 的設定。您可以直接加入望遠鏡或編輯詳細資訊。",
